5:["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-6 text-ink-soft","children":"Delray Beach police found 28-year-old Edward Tuttle lying naked and unconscious, face-down in the grass of an intersection. As an officer shook him awake, Tuttle stood up and, without warning, punched the officer in the nose. He was tased and taken into custody, still naked, and later admitted he had been drunk."}]
